<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Monday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>     28 days     900 million pesos  26.68 pct</p>
<p>     91 days     900 million pesos  24.89 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  22.67 pct</p>
<p>    363 days     600 million pesos  20.55 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 500 million pesos worth of 363-day and the same amount of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
